{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22406","headline":"别李十一後重寄 · 白居易","name":"别李十一後重寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋日正萧条，驱车出蓬荜。\n回望青门道，目极心郁郁。\n岂独恋乡土，非关慕簪绂。\n所怆别李君，平生同道术。\n俱承金马诏，联秉谏臣笔。\n共上青云梯，中途一相失。\n江湖我方往，朝廷君不出。\n蕙带与华簪，相逢是何日。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22406.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22406","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}